# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research output and state -- NEVER commit these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reports are written into this repo directory by cli._write_outputs(), and
# they contain the full text of whatever you researched plus every source you
# read. On a public repo that is both a privacy leak and a record of your
# interests. The .json sidecar carries the complete ResearchState.
reports/
*.report.md

# SQLite research database: questions, claims, sources, cached page text.
# Default location is ~/.deepresearch/research.db (outside the repo), but a
# --db flag can put one anywhere.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.deepresearch/
research.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials and local config
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This tool is designed to run on subscription auth with no API key at all.
# These patterns exist so a stray key file can never be committed by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
secrets.*
credentials.*
.netrc

# Claude Code local state. The bundled research skills under .claude/skills/
# ARE part of the project and must stay tracked, so this un-ignores them.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled bytecode embeds the ABSOLUTE source path of the machine that built
# it (e.g. C:\Users\<name>\...), which leaks your username on a public repo.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib60/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.python-version

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
